{"id":"b73b77ae86e33532","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-preservation-union-chains.md","title":"Union of Elementary Chains","display":"thm-preservation-union-chains — Union of Elementary Chains","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-preservation-union-chains","aliases":["57-thm-preservation-union-chains"],"display":"thm-preservation-union-chains — Union of Elementary Chains","depends_on":["[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-substructure]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-preservation-union-chains"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-preservation-union-chains</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-preservation-union-chains — Union of Elementary Chains"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a7fe4775125052f\" href=\"?note=6a7fe4775125052f\" title=\"57-df-elementary-substructure\">57-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90dc104b21b5c21e\" href=\"?note=90dc104b21b5c21e\" title=\"57-df-substructure\">57-df-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>背景集合论为 ZFC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\alpha\">\\(0&lt;\\alpha\\)</span> 为序数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\alpha}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\alpha}\\)</span> 为同一字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的结构族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_i=\\langle A_i,I_i\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak A_i=\\langle A_i,I_i\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\alpha\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\subseteq\\mathfrak A_j)\">\\(\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\alpha\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\subseteq\\mathfrak A_j)\\)</span>。子结构与初等子结构见依赖文件。函数解释按函数图并集，常量解释在整条链上相同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}\\mathfrak A_i\">\\(\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}\\mathfrak A_i\\)</span> 是下式的结构并记号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA_*&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}A_i,\\\\\nI_*(c)&amp;\\coloneqq I_0(c)\\quad(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S),\\\\\nI_*(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}I_i(f)\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S),\\\\\nI_*(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}I_i(R)\\quad(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S),\\\\\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}\\mathfrak A_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A_*,I_*\\rangle.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA_*&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}A_i,\\\\\nI_*(c)&amp;\\coloneqq I_0(c)\\quad(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S),\\\\\nI_*(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}I_i(f)\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S),\\\\\nI_*(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}I_i(R)\\quad(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S),\\\\\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}\\mathfrak A_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A_*,I_*\\rangle.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left[\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\alpha\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\preceq\\mathfrak A_j)\\right]\\to\\forall i&lt;\\alpha\\;\\left(\\mathfrak A_i\\preceq\\bigcup_{j&lt;\\alpha}\\mathfrak A_j\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left[\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\alpha\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\preceq\\mathfrak A_j)\\right]\\to\\forall i&lt;\\alpha\\;\\left(\\mathfrak A_i\\preceq\\bigcup_{j&lt;\\alpha}\\mathfrak A_j\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留结构并的原写法，但不将结构的有序对编码直接取集合并。非空链及两两初等包含均不可省略。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"6a7fe4775125052f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"90dc104b21b5c21e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"0<\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i<\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A_i=\\langle A_i,I_i\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i<j<\\alpha\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\subseteq\\mathfrak A_j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{i<\\alpha}\\mathfrak A_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nA_*&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i<\\alpha}A_i,\\\\\nI_*(c)&\\coloneqq I_0(c)\\quad(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S),\\\\\nI_*(f)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i<\\alpha}I_i(f)\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S),\\\\\nI_*(R)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i<\\alpha}I_i(R)\\quad(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S),\\\\\n\\bigcup_{i<\\alpha}\\mathfrak A_